How this list was produced
--------------------------
  Go:   go-licenses report ./cmd/...   (run for linux/amd64 and, for the agent,
        GOOS=windows), at the versions pinned in go.mod / go.sum.
  npm:  npx license-checker --production --summary   in web/, at the versions
        pinned in web/package-lock.json.

