Vulnerability data
------------------
The Grype vulnerability database is not part of this distribution. The server
downloads it at run time from Anchore's public database service (or from a
mirror that the operator configures). It aggregates advisories from several
upstream sources (NVD, GitHub Security Advisories, Linux distribution security
trackers, EPSS and CISA KEV), each with its own terms. Operators who mirror or
redistribute the database should review those terms.

Container image
---------------
The Docker image built from deploy/docker/Dockerfile is based on debian:bookworm-slim
and contains Debian packages (ca-certificates, tzdata, libcap2-bin and their
dependencies) under their own licences, including GPL-licensed components that
are not linked into Sentrel. See /usr/share/doc/*/copyright in the image.

